[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2101.43, "timestamp": "00:35:01", "text": "积分。是的，所以，星期四有……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2103.241, "timestamp": "00:35:03", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "dang i cant keep track of days anymore"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2104.95, "timestamp": "00:35:04", "text": "一个空缺职位。我觉得我还有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2108.87, "timestamp": "00:35:08", "text": "联系那些待定的人，并与他们互动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2111.349, "timestamp": "00:35:11", "text": "呃，联系了那些没有回应的人。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2114.47, "timestamp": "00:35:14", "text": "这里需要添加一些人，而且呃，我想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2116.79, "timestamp": "00:35:16", "text": "也要主动与人交流。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2118.55, "timestamp": "00:35:18", "text": "同意的人不多，所以我不得不说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2128.23, "timestamp": "00:35:28", "text": "嗯，当然。是的。呃，但我自由了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2133.589, "timestamp": "00:35:33", "text": "直到21号，但第二周是每周一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2136.55, "timestamp": "00:35:36", "text": "从12到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2139.27, "timestamp": "00:35:39", "text": "呃，第三周或第四周，呃，结束"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2141.829, "timestamp": "00:35:41", "text": "六月，虽然我到最后才会离开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2144.39, "timestamp": "00:35:44", "text": "六月份我还有考试，所以只能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2150.23, "timestamp": "00:35:50", "text": "很遗憾，只能在晚上家长会时间做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2154.71, "timestamp": "00:35:54", "text": "嗯，这取决于我的考试时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2157.27, "timestamp": "00:35:57", "text": "呃，等等，我记得我放过……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2159.19, "timestamp": "00:35:59", "text": "这里有个考试之类的东西。它在哪里？在哪里？"}]